<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - OMI started as a neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - OMI started as a neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of OMI Corp with a neutral rating, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 3/8 to 8-5/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
